OL,3,GNEWSAWork continues to restore water
OL,4,Asupplies
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnglian Water says it is working hard
OL,7,Fto restore supplies to hundreds of
OL,8,Fcustomers still affected by water
OL,9,Fissues in parts of Lincolnshire.
OL,11,FOn Thursday, 36,000 customers in
OL,12,FScunthorpe and the surrounding area
OL,13,Fwere left with no water or low pressure
OL,14,Fafter the flow of water into a local
OL,15,Fstorage reservoir stopped due to two
OL,16,Fburst pipes.
OL,18,FThe firm said 1,800 customers in Kirton
OL,19,Fin Lindsey were still without water on
OL,20,FFriday morning.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
