OL,3,GNEWSAWork continues to restore water
OL,4,Asupplies
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Staples, director of corporate
OL,7,Faffairs, apologised for the disruption
OL,8,Fcaused, saying it had been "incredibly
OL,9,Fhard and difficult" for customers.
